@startuml
title Teacher Control Layout - State Model
class TeacherTeamView {
  +displayExistingTeamFields()
  +omitLeaderPresenceField()
}
class ActivityControls {
  +joinControlVisible
  +startControlVisible
  +endControlVisible
  +endControlAvailable
  +startAnswering()
  +endAnswering()
}
class QuestionProgressView {
  +preserveQuestionOrder()
  +showFourTilesPerRow()
  +keepUnusedSlotsBlank()
}
enum ActivityStage {
  Preparation
  Answering
  Ended
}
ActivityControls --> ActivityStage : reflects
note right of ActivityControls
Preparation: join/start visible;
end control is not shown.
Answering: join/start hidden;
end visible at former join position.
Ended: end remains visible and unavailable.
end note
note bottom of TeacherTeamView
Roster column width weights:
group name/code 2; online count 1;
join status 1.
end note
@enduml
